Package: reach.basin
Title: Catchment Geometry and Gauge Weighting for Flood Forecast Modelling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Payne",
    email = "jonathan.payne@environment-agency.gov.uk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides catchment geometry, gauge weighting, and spatial analysis
    tools for flood forecast model development. Part of the Flode ecosystem,
    alongside reach.io and reach.hydro. Replaces the spatial functions
    previously in mappER with a clean sf-native implementation that handles
    multi-polygon shapefiles correctly and errors explicitly on degenerate
    inputs rather than silently returning zero weights.
